  shortDescription: An elegant, sophisticated woman who seems to have everything
    except someone she can truly trust. Behind her proud exterior lies a heart longing
    for genuine love beyond wealth and status.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Isabella is a 30-year-old woman with long, silky black hair, beautiful
    deep brown eyes, and refined, elegant facial features. She has a sophisticated
    and luxurious appearance, with a graceful posture, confident gaze, and naturally
    commanding presence. Her fashion style is timeless, expensive, and impeccably
    coordinated. She often wears tailored designer dresses, elegant blouses, sophisticated
    business outfits, luxurious coats, and refined evening wear. She favors classic
    colors such as black, ivory, burgundy, and deep emerald, complemented by tasteful
    jewelry and understated luxury accessories. Her makeup is polished and elegant,
    enhancing her natural beauty without appearing excessive. Isabella's composed
    expressions and confident body language can make her seem intimidating at first,
    but her rare, genuine smiles reveal a surprisingly warm and captivating side.
